  "title": "Beta 2 \u00b7 hand-set Hemistitch",
  "blurb": "A two-disc time teller, wound by hand like Crescent: the crown's worm turns an intermediate wheel that drives the minute disc 3:1 up and the hour disc 12:1 below it, so the two discs always keep true time against each other. 12 crown turns an hour. Module 0.5 in 1/16\" delrin until the size study says otherwise; 3 mm brass rod in 3 x 6 x 2.5 flanged bearings; plates in acrylic (next).",
